            <title>[ZEPPELIN-1276] Notebook Name input is not disappearing anymore</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/ZEPPELIN-1276</link>
                <project id="12316221" key="ZEPPELIN">Zeppelin</project>
